{"screen_name": "kRoble", "file": "kRoble-b3f51d", "name": "kRoble", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2010589013858746368/L_F7_Gdp.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1792190909733621760/1766656884/1500x500", "description": "Make art　絵描きます\n\nhttps://bsky.app/profile/krobleee.bsky.social", "total_works": 5, "scraped_works": 5, "first_seen": "2026-03-20T16:52:10.826996+00:00", "last_updated": "2026-03-20T16:52:10.826996+00:00", "price_history": {"art": [{"amount": 12000, "recorded_at": "2026-03-20T16:52:10.826996+00:00"}]}, "current_prices": {"art": 12000}, "price_range": {"art": {"min": 12000, "max": 12000}}, "links": [{"label": "Twitter", "url": "https://x.com/kRobleee", "name": "kRobleee"}, {"label": "Pixiv", "url": "https://www.pixiv.net/users/106667139", "name": "106667139"}], "flags": {}, "acceptable": true, "works": [{"path": "/@kRoble/works/5", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/75da5072/uploads/origins/ec9c3e1a-ac63-4d5c-b098-5689facf457f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0f35c033c137af9bce5bf2159150832f", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/75da5072/uploads/origins/ec9c3e1a-ac63-4d5c-b098-5689facf457f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0f35c033c137af9bce5bf2159150832f, https://si.imgix.net/75da5072/uploads/origins/ec9c3e1a-ac63-4d5c-b098-5689facf457f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2847f4c86b95fa4aa0e707e40d9226f7 2x, https://si.imgix.net/75da5072/uploads/origins/ec9c3e1a-ac63-4d5c-b098-5689facf457f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=48104a5af76e0687a8be1519f71a3806 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！アピールありがとうございます！あなたの絵はとても素敵で、ぜひ私のVTuberキャラクターの絵をお願いしたいです！\nhttps://twitter.com/Erurichu/status/1712549091006464290。\n彼はスペルカードを使って戦う放浪魔道士で、世界について学び、できる限り他の人を助けたいと思っています。\nバレンタインデーのためのアートというアイデアが大好きです。できれば、製菓職人の服を着て、チョコレートの入ったボウルを混ぜてほしい。\nあとはお任せします。\nアートはソーシャルメディアへの投稿や、場合によっては動画のサムネイルに使わせていただきます。\nありがとうございました！\n\nhttps://twitter.com/Erurichu/status/1712549091006464290", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kRoble/works/4", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/6dcdc621/uploads/origins/b8ca0475-3871-4381-bfc3-b0773b988d72?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3f51ca377b093161d7ef139668473cfe", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6dcdc621/uploads/origins/b8ca0475-3871-4381-bfc3-b0773b988d72?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3f51ca377b093161d7ef139668473cfe, https://si.imgix.net/6dcdc621/uploads/origins/b8ca0475-3871-4381-bfc3-b0773b988d72?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5b2c66a56a4beb672422a7a45200b06f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/6dcdc621/uploads/origins/b8ca0475-3871-4381-bfc3-b0773b988d72?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f86608811c6d31a0bc5f4356308eb347 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは、あなたの絵をいくつか見たんだけど、あなたの作風がとても好きなの！僕のOCのドラゴンの女の子、シンシアを描いてほしいんだ。主な特徴（目、髪、肌の色、角、翼、尻尾）が同じであれば、どんな風に描いても構いません。それ以外は自由です！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1NdDdFvCSO56DuqxUfPAtigwGekOaAo3e/view?usp=drive_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kRoble/works/3", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/7d69263d/uploads/origins/d78dcc03-0267-42ce-85c5-941c5f0cb18b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b817ef42d6073e41883354c22eca5d87", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7d69263d/uploads/origins/d78dcc03-0267-42ce-85c5-941c5f0cb18b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b817ef42d6073e41883354c22eca5d87, https://si.imgix.net/7d69263d/uploads/origins/d78dcc03-0267-42ce-85c5-941c5f0cb18b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=21b46bf4bb7031b14fe4582a92730831 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7d69263d/uploads/origins/d78dcc03-0267-42ce-85c5-941c5f0cb18b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ecd699081d264a8bb1d08bf05ec3f985 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hi, thank you for the appeal. I would like to take you up on your suggested scenario, where Reina is walking around late at night, where the streets are mostly empty.\n\nI would like the background to convey a lonely atmosphere for Reina. In Reina's world, vampires coexist peacefully with humans, forced to abide human laws because of their declining numbers. While Reina loves humanity, she knows that she will never be truly like them. But despite that, she still tries to find happiness in life. Humans invented pro wrestling, after all.\n\nPlease draw her in the fashion of someone going out for a midnight convenience store run:\n- Hoodie (hood up to conceal her vampire ears)\n- Track pants\n- Black mouth mask\n- Comfortable footwear (something like Crocs)\n\nI leave the minor details up to you.\n\nI have been coming up with new ideas for Reina whenever I make a new request, yet I've never really considered this scenario. So thank you for making me think about it!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/u/2/folders/1OqBDSVcleRYwaIhiDFwHMTuCda9R5iL8", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kRoble/works/2", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/49672386/uploads/origins/a7448879-d2f6-4dce-b43b-86e16f296526?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=abfe1cc93ff7b2bcbd520d710e93c97d", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/49672386/uploads/origins/a7448879-d2f6-4dce-b43b-86e16f296526?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=abfe1cc93ff7b2bcbd520d710e93c97d, https://si.imgix.net/49672386/uploads/origins/a7448879-d2f6-4dce-b43b-86e16f296526?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9cb1a23233ea95fecbabb7bcda659e02 2x, https://si.imgix.net/49672386/uploads/origins/a7